      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-28T11:05:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, but does the check against the maximum supported image size hurts us here? Just something like this, but not need to guard with ZTEST.\n```\n\tif (image_buf_size \u003c CONFIG_FINGERPRINT_SENSOR_IMAGE_SIZE)\n\t\treturn -EINVAL;\n```",
      "parentUuid": "33eb928e_a3daefee",
      "revId": "2c06add7bb76eb1489e30a87f69f7761784ba285",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
