      "writtenOn": "2026-04-28T11:18:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the existing code, this check would not cause an immediate issue.\nHowever, from a logical perspective, it is not entirely appropriate.\nWe currently support at least two different capture sizes, but this check compares against a single fixed size, which does not accurately reflect that.\nAt the moment, I don’t have a better solution for handling multiple capture types cleanly, so keeping the behavior as it was before this CL may be a possible way.",
      "parentUuid": "9c9fcadc_9766e9c1",
